# Part H — Container Security: Governed Trivy exceptions only.
# Every CVE listed here MUST correspond to a logged waiver in the
# security-gates/dependency-scan/policies/severity-policy.json process.
#
# Format: CVE-ID  # Exception ID | Justification | Review date
#
# Example (template — remove once real exceptions exist):
# CVE-0000-00000  # EXC-2026-000 | False positive, not reachable in our runtime | Review: 2026-12-31
